observation = "At this base verifyWebSearchPayment calls verifySequencerReceipt and never consumes committed inclusion; the exact rows in the local metered capture are historical legacy transactions while gateway/exact.json contains the subsequently recorded type-2 transactions. Adding activityIds to these seller receipts cannot repair their mismatched raw bytes; follow the matching producer recordings. Node inclusion activityIds are supplied in the committed-receipt case."

